ites/3cWazGUcKJvNvjeJ1tVTwG/kSViim4qY.CzcXX525.mjs"><link rel="modulepreload" fetchpriority="low" href="https://framerusercontent.com/sites/3cWazGUcKJvNvjeJ1tVTwG/MupMlQwE0.Db5r9bpP.mjs"><link rel="modulepreload" fetchpriority="low" href="https://framerusercontent.com/sites/3cWazGUcKJvNvjeJ1tVTwG/N_p51dKpR.BY_HGdd6.mjs"><link rel="modulepreload" fetchpriority="low" href="https://framerusercontent.com/sites/3cWazGUcKJvNvjeJ1tVTwG/ARDZyocPI.DjPWnORp.mjs"><link rel="modulepreload" fetchpriority="low" href="https://framerusercontent.com/sites/3cWazGUcKJvNvjeJ1tVTwG/mpvPWr82u.DIytEruL.mjs"><link rel="modulepreload" fetchpriority="low" href="https://framerusercontent.com/sites/3cWazGUcKJvNvjeJ1tVTwG/kKFOnFSJ0.-4W5u9JQ.mjs"><link rel="modulepreload" fetchpriority="low" href="https://framerusercontent.com/sites/3cWazGUcKJvNvjeJ1tVTwG/GDqWhUBfp.DrliM4kV.mjs"><link rel="modulepreload" data-framer-lazy="34plgijokcvdi" fetchpriority="low" href="https://framerusercontent.com/sites/3cWazGUcKJvNvjeJ1tVTwG/Vimeo.BlKv3jb2.mjs"><script type="module" async data-framer-bundle="main" fetchpriority="low" src="https://framerusercontent.com/sites/3cWazGUcKJvNvjeJ1tVTwG/script_main.C2jvIdPR.mjs"></script><script type="framer/handover" id="__framer__handoverData">[{"0":1,"1":31},["Map",2,3],"{\"from\":\"390e32a2-fcb7-42ad-a55a-f2977baaf60d\",\"select\":[{\"collection\":\"GDqWhUBfp\",\"name\":\"fFWfm2uhG\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"GDqWhUBfp\",\"name\":\"kRZuc5uv3\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"GDqWhUBfp\",\"name\":\"zggPTkIjw\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"GDqWhUBfp\",\"name\":\"U5drSK6Xs\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"GDqWhUBfp\",\"name\":\"aAIbkigfg\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"GDqWhUBfp\",\"name\":\"FpXjQCmKC\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"GDqWhUBfp\",\"name\":\"POc1pw164\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"}],\"where\":{\"type\":\"BinaryOperation\",\"operator\":\"==\",\"left\":{\"type\":\"TypeCast\",\"value\":{\"type\":\"Identifier\",\"name\":\"ab1hhKxyn\",\"collection\":\"GDqWhUBfp\"},\"dataType\":\"STRING\"},\"right\":{\"type\":\"LiteralValue\",\"value\":\"high-roas-ugc-ads\"}}}default",[4],{"fFWfm2uhG":5,"kRZuc5uv3":12,"zggPTkIjw":15,"U5drSK6Xs":17,"aAIbkigfg":22,"FpXjQCmKC":25,"POc1pw164":28},{"type":6,"value":7},"responsiveimage",{"src":8,"srcSet":9,"pixelWidth":10,"pixelHeight":11},"https://framerusercontent.com/images/BmUk0KMAPqqpLzpARwDdXhfg.gif?width=1014&height=720","https://framerusercontent.com/images/BmUk0KMAPqqpLzpARwDdXhfg.gif?scale-down-to=512&width=1014&height=720 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/BmUk0KMAPqqpLzpARwDdXhfg.gif?width=1014&height=720 1014w",1014,720,{"type":13,"value":14},"string","High ROAS UGC Ads",{"type":13,"value":16},"Every script follows a Multiple Hooks → Body → CTA structure engineered for watch time and keeps viewers past the 15-second mark through storytelling — not selling.",{"type":18,"value":19},"richtext",{"collectionId":20,"pointer":21},"390e32a2-fcb7-42ad-a55a-f2977baaf60ddefault","[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Most UGC ads lose viewers by second 3. The creative looks authentic, the creator is likeable, but the script has no structure — no reason to keep watching. \"],[4,\"br\",null],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"The result: wasted spend and ROAS that never climbs past break-even. \"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"High-ROAS UGC ads solve this with a specific script architecture: multiple hooks at the top, a body that earns attention through storytelling, and a CTA placed at peak engagement. Every element is engineered for watch time — because watch time is what platforms reward with cheaper distribution.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",{\"className\":\"trailing-break\"}]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Why Most UGC Ads Fail at ROAS\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The problem isn't production quality or creator selection. It's script structure. Most brands hand creators a brief that says \\\"talk about the product\\\" — and the result is a 30-second monologue that viewers skip in 2 seconds. The ads that drive measurable ROAS share three structural elements:\"]],[4,\"ul\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Multiple hook variations tested per script — not one opening, but 3-4, each designed to stop a different segment of the audience\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"A body that uses storytelling (problem → discovery → result) instead of feature listing\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"CTAs placed at the moment of peak emotional engagement, not bolted onto the end\"]],[4,\"p\",null,[4,\"br\",{\"className\":\"trailing-break\"}]]]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The Multiple Hooks → Body → CTA Framework\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"This is the script architecture \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"OKAD Agency\"]],[5,\" uses across every UGC ad project. It's not a creative philosophy — it's an engineering decision based on platform algorithms and viewer behavior data.\"]],[4,\"img\",{\"alt\":\"\",\"width\":\"1191\",\"height\":\"578\",\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/99wsZM1bYBlgk1rXgRvN4hkuLtQ.png\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/99wsZM1bYBlgk1rXgRvN4hkuLtQ.png?scale-down-to=512&width=2382&height=1156 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/99wsZM1bYBlgk1rXgRvN4hkuLtQ.png?scale-down-to=1024&width=2382&height=1156 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/99wsZM1bYBlgk1rXgRvN4hkuLtQ.png?scale-down-to=2048&width=2382&height=1156 2048w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/99wsZM1bYBlgk1rXgRvN4hkuLtQ.png?width=2382&height=1156 2382w\",\"className\":\"framer-image\",\"style\":{\"aspectRatio\":\"2382 / 1156\"}}],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"Hooks (first 1-3 seconds): \"]],[5,\"Each script gets 3-4 hook variations. One might lead with a question (\\\"I was spending $200/month on skincare until...\\\"), another with a bold claim (\\\"This replaced my entire morning routine\\\"), another with a pattern interrupt (unexpected visual or sound). The hooks are modular — they can be swapped without reshooting the body of the ad. This means one production day generates dozens of testable combinations.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"Body (seconds 3-20): \"]],[5,\"The body earns the next 15 seconds through narrative structure, not product features. The viewer stays because they want to know what happened — not because they care about ingredients or specs. Storytelling formats that consistently outperform: personal transformation (\\\"here's what changed\\\"), unexpected discovery (\\\"I wasn't looking for this but...\\\"), and social proof narrative (\\\"my friend told me to try this and I didn't believe her\\\").\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"CTA (seconds 15-30):\"]],[5,\" The CTA lands when the viewer is most invested in the story — typically right after the transformation reveal or the social proof payoff. \\\"Link in bio\\\" at peak engagement converts 3-5x better than the same CTA at the end of a flat product demo.\"]],[4,\"h4\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"How Longevity Used Storytelling to Hold Viewers Past 15 Seconds\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"Longevity\"]],[5,\" (supplements for men 40+, Europe-to-US market) faced a unique challenge: the product requires education. You can't sell longevity supplements with a 3-second hook and a discount code. The audience needs to understand why they should care — and that takes time. \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"OKAD Agency\"]],[5,\" built the entire creative testing framework from scratch, including what constitutes a test, A/B variation structure, winner identification criteria, and reporting templates. \"],[4,\"br\",null],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"The scripts used a doctor-figure storytelling format — an authority character walking the viewer through the science in plain language, supported by AI-generated organ visualizations that made abstract health concepts tangible. \"]],[4,\"div\",{\"className\":\"framer-text-module\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"aspectRatio\":\"480 / 270\"},\"data-width\":\"fill\"},[3,\"module:0sWquksFr1YDkaIgrl9Z/VgWe6mCMJOseqaLiMnaC/Vimeo.js:default\",{\"video\":\"https://vimeo.com/1125553641\",\"controls\":true,\"autoplay\":false,\"loop\":false,\"mute\":false},[],[]]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"The result: 15+ second average watch time on paid ads — well past the critical mark where platforms start rewarding the creative with cheaper impressions. Multilingual content (DE, DK, EN) with educational storytelling proved that even complex, education-heavy products can hold attention when the script is built around narrative, not features.\"]],[4,\"h4\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"VueSwiss and InstaHeadshots: 3 Hook Variations Per Script at Scale\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"VueSwiss\"]],[5,\" (Swiss skincare) and \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"InstaHeadshots\"]],[5,\" (AI headshot generator) both operate at high creative volume — and both prove that the multiple-hooks model scales. \"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"VueSwiss\"]],[5,\" produces ~30 videos per day: 10+ base scripts, each with 3+ hook variations, sustaining stable order volume for 2-3 months running. The hooks aren't random — each variation targets a different audience segment or emotional trigger. One hook might lead with vanity (\\\"your skin after 2 weeks\\\"), another with skepticism (\\\"I didn't believe Swiss skincare was worth the price\\\"), another with social proof (\\\"my dermatologist recommended this\\\"). \"]],[4,\"div\",{\"className\":\"framer-text-module\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"aspectRatio\":\"480 / 270\"},\"data-width\":\"fill\"},[3,\"module:0sWquksFr1YDkaIgrl9Z/VgWe6mCMJOseqaLiMnaC/Vimeo.js:default\",{\"video\":\"https://vimeo.com/1145546391\",\"controls\":true,\"autoplay\":false,\"loop\":false,\"mute\":false},[],[]]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"InstaHeadshots\"]],[5,\" follows the same framework: 70 scripts across talking head, voiceover, and music+text formats — each with 3 distinct hook variations. The hooks are tested systematically: which opening drives the highest view-to-15-second retention, which converts to clicks, which produces the best CPA. The modular structure means creative testing velocity stays high without proportional increases in production cost.\"]],[4,\"div\",{\"className\":\"framer-text-module\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"aspectRatio\":\"480 / 270\"},\"data-width\":\"fill\"},[3,\"module:0sWquksFr1YDkaIgrl9Z/VgWe6mCMJOseqaLiMnaC/Vimeo.js:default\",{\"video\":\"https://vimeo.com/1192409653\",\"controls\":true,\"autoplay\":false,\"loop\":false,\"mute\":false},[],[]]],[4,\"h4\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Lookalikey and ZenToes: Strong Hooks + Dynamic Editing\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Some products need more than a good script — they need editing that matches the energy of the hook. \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"Lookalikey\"]],[5,\" (AI photo app) and \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"ZenToes\"]],[5,\" (foot care, Walmart launch) both required creative where the editing itself became part of the hook. \"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"For \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"ZenToes\"]],[5,\", \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"OKAD Agency\"]],[5,\" produced 10 static and 10 video ads using a modular hook-testing framework — 3-4 different hooks per video, each designed to stop the scroll in a commodity category where every competitor's ad looks the same. The editing approach: fast cuts between before/after shots, dynamic text overlays that reveal information in sync with the voiceover, and visual transitions timed to keep the viewer's eye moving. The result: \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"8%+ view-to-25-second retention\"]],[5,\" rates — a benchmark most DTC brands struggle to reach at 4%. \"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"Lookalikey's\"]],[5,\" ads combine the same hook-testing methodology with editing designed for the AI/tech audience: screen recordings, transformation reveals, and side-by-side comparisons that demonstrate the product in real time. The dynamic editing style — quick cuts, zoom-ins on details, split-screen before/after — keeps engagement high through visual storytelling rather than verbal explanation.\"]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",{\"className\":\"trailing-break\"}]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Why Watch Time Drives ROAS\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The connection between watch time and ROAS isn't philosophical — it's mechanical. Meta, TikTok, and YouTube all use watch time as a primary signal for ad quality scoring. Higher watch time = higher quality score = lower CPM = more impressions per dollar = better ROAS. The math is straightforward:\"]],[4,\"ul\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"A 15-second ad with 80% completion rate gets dramatically cheaper distribution than a 15-second ad with 30% completion\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Cheaper distribution means more impressions per dollar\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"More impressions at the same conversion rate = higher ROAS\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"The compounding effect: better watch time → cheaper CPMs → more data → faster optimization → even better ROAS\"]]]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"This is why script structure matters more than production quality. A well-structured UGC script shot on an iPhone will outperform a poorly structured studio ad every time — because the algorithm rewards the one people actually watch.\"]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",{\"className\":\"trailing-break\"}]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Measuring UGC Ad Performance\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The metrics that matter for high-ROAS UGC campaigns:\"]],[4,\"ul\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"View-to-15-second retention: The single most important leading indicator. If viewers aren't making it to second 15, the script structure needs work — not the creative polish.\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Hook-through rate: What percentage of viewers make it past the first 3 seconds? Test this across all hook variations to identify winners.\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"CPA by hook variation: Different hooks attract different audience segments. Some hooks drive higher volume at higher CPA; others drive lower volume at lower CPA. The right choice depends on your scaling goals.\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"ROAS by creative: Track at the individual creative level, not the campaign level. One winning creative can carry an entire campaign — identify it fast and scale it.\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Creative fatigue timeline: How many days before a winning creative's performance degrades? Plan your production calendar around this number.\"]]]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",{\"className\":\"trailing-break\"}]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The Production Model Behind Consistent ROAS\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"High ROAS isn't a one-time win — it requires a production system that generates testable creative at consistent velocity. \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"OKAD Agency's\"]],[5,\" model:\"]],[4,\"ul\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"626+ vetted UGC creators\"]],[5,\" across niches — matched by audience, not just category\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Modular script architecture — every script designed for 3-4 hook swaps without reshooting\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"48-72 hour turnaround from brief to deliverable\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Systematic hook testing — data decides winners, not creative instinct\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Cross-platform optimization — same base creative adapted for TikTok, Meta, and YouTube Shorts\"]]]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"This infrastructure powered \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"ZenToes\"]],[5,\"' Walmart launch (20 ad variations from one production cycle), \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"VueSwiss\"]],[5,\"' sustained ~30 videos/day output, and \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"Longevity's\"]],[5,\" multilingual testing framework — each proving that ROAS scales with creative velocity, not creative budget.\"]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",{\"className\":\"trailing-break\"}]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"OKAD Agency Services\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"OKAD Agency\"]],[5,\" specializes in high-ROAS UGC ad production with a script-first methodology:\"]],[4,\"ul\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"UGC script writing with Multiple Hooks → Body → CTA architecture\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Hook testing and creative strategy (3-4 hooks per script, modular swapping)\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Storytelling-driven scripts engineered for 15+ second watch time\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"High-volume production: \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"VueSwiss\"]],[5,\" (~30 videos/day), \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"InstaHeadshots\"]],[5,\" (70 scripts with 3 hook variations each)\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Dynamic editing for hook-driven formats (fast cuts, before/after reveals, split-screen)\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Creator sourcing from \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"626+ vetted UGC creators\"]]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Cross-platform optimization for TikTok, Meta, and YouTube\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Performance tracking: view-to-15s retention, hook-through rate, CPA by variation, ROAS by creative\"]]]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",{\"className\":\"trailing-break\"}]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"FAQs\"]],[4,\"h4\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"What makes a UGC ad \\\"high ROAS\\\"?\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"A high-ROAS UGC ad combines strong watch time (driven by script structure, not production quality) with a CTA placed at peak engagement. The Multiple Hooks → Body → CTA framework consistently outperforms single-hook scripts because it allows systematic testing of which opening drives the best performance for each audience segment. \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"OKAD Agency's\"]],[5,\" campaigns achieve \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"8%+ view-to-25-second retention\"]],[5,\" through this methodology.\"]],[4,\"h4\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"How many hook variations should each UGC script have?\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Three to four hook variations per script is the standard for systematic testing. Fewer than three doesn't generate enough data to identify winners; more than four creates diminishing returns relative to production cost. \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"VueSwiss\"]],[5,\" runs 3+ hooks per base script across ~30 videos per day — proving the model scales.\"]],[4,\"h4\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Why does watch time matter more than click-through rate?\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Watch time directly affects your CPM. Platforms reward ads that hold attention with cheaper distribution — which means more impressions per dollar before a single click happens. A high-watch-time ad with a moderate CTR will outperform a low-watch-time ad with a high CTR on total ROAS, because the distribution cost advantage compounds across every impression.\"]],[4,\"h4\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"How do you maintain ROAS as you scale creative volume?\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The key is modular production: scripts designed so hooks can be swapped without reshooting, creators matched by audience segment, and systematic testing that lets data — not instinct — decide winners. \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"OKAD Agency's\"]],[5,\" model produces dozens of testable variations from each production cycle, keeping creative velocity high while controlling costs.\"]]]",{"type":23,"value":24},"date","2026-05-18T00:00:00.000Z",{"type":26,"value":27},"number",4,{"type":29,"value":30},"enum","WfJ5fq8wI",["Map"]]</script><div id="svg-templates" style="position: absolute; overflow: hidden; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 0; height: 0; z-index: 0; contain: strict" aria-hidden="true">
